{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-2-1","title":"John 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ turns water into wine; 12 departs into Capernaum, 13 and to Jerusalem, 14 where he purges the temple of buyers and sellers. 18 He foretells his death and resurrection. 23 Many believe because of his miracles, but he will not trust himself with them.</p>\n<p>A.M. 4034. A.D. 30. the third. 1:43 a marriage. Ge 1:27,28; 2:18-25; Ps 128:1-4; Pr 18:22; 19:14; 31:10-12 Eph 5:30-33; 1Ti 4:1-3; Heb 13:4 Cana. 4:46; 21:2; Jos 19:28 Kanah.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-2-2","title":"John 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>both. Mt 12:19; Lu 7:34-38; 1Co 7:39; 10:31; Col 3:17; Re 3:20 his. Mt 10:40-42; 25:40,45 the marriage. Heb 13:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-2-3","title":"John 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>they wanted. Ps 104:15; Ec 10:19; Isa 24:11; Mt 26:28 They have. 11:3; Php 4:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-2-4","title":"John 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Woman. 19:26,27; 20:13,15; Mt 15:28 what. De 33:9; 2Sa 16:10; 19:22; Lu 2:49; 2Co 5:16; Ga 2:5,6 mine. 7:6,30; 8:20; 12:23; 13:1; Ec 3:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-2-5","title":"John 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Whatsoever. 15:14; Ge 6:22; Jud 13:14; Lu 5:5,6; 6:46-49; Ac 9:6; Heb 5:9; 11:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-2-6","title":"John 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>after. 3:25; Mr 7:2-5; Eph 5:26; Heb 6:2; 9:10,19; 10:22</p>"},{"id":